{"data": [{"author_id": "1666549125859647488", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:49:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116286374076674109"], "id": "2116286374076674109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Neuralink surgical scar. Fascinating from a medical perspective.\n\nThis is my first time seeing the postoperative incision and closure associated with a brain-computer interface.\n\nAs a physician and technologist, seeing the intersection of neurosurgery, engineering, and AI", "url": "https://x.com/TechMDAI/status/2116286374076674109"}, {"author_id": "2066411673485996032", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:35:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116282924228026430"], "id": "2116282924228026430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#首尔城北    #首尔瑞草  #脑机接口  小舟横截春江，卧看翠壁红楼起 ##journalismi https://t.co/RwaepWHWmu", "url": "https://x.com/DanisAarn1553/status/2116282924228026430"}, {"author_id": "1538493684789878786", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:32:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116282133413245332"], "id": "2116282133413245332", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说人类在寻求“量子力学的感受野”，一下子戳中了现代物理学和认知科学最痛的那个死结：我们已经用数学公式把触角伸进了量子世界，但我们的生物大脑在面对它时，依然是个彻底的“瞎子”。", "url": "https://x.com/skskssndjdm/status/2116282133413245332"}, {"author_id": "726566515", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:09:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116276215082615113"], "id": "2116276215082615113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The military had a top secret operation to conspire to use BCI technology to destroy my ability to have sex. I'm a virgin.", "url": "https://x.com/fiercedeity0/status/2116276215082615113"}, {"author_id": "2042087353141915648", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:16:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116277983413784772"], "id": "2116277983413784772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Theres a bci located on the optic nerves of targeted individuals you can feel it when you stimulate your eye with an electric muscle stimulator that I modified to fit inside the nasal cavity", "url": "https://x.com/xinnerneox/status/2116277983413784772"}, {"author_id": "22481878", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:33:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116282353714897251"], "id": "2116282353714897251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I would welcome more academic research related to sound-guided functional vision (with or without visual mental imagery) https://t.co/80StqEhU9R Look ma, no brain implant! 🤯 #noninvasive #BCI #blindness #neuroscience #AcademicChatter", "url": "https://x.com/seeingwithsound/status/2116282353714897251"}, {"author_id": "1940151531132620800", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:56:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116288217498767670"], "id": "2116288217498767670", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115918744308658325", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This feels a lot less relevant for building a quality BCI for consumer use than for revelation that makes neural data appealing to be bought by a frontier lab https://t.co/uJZ7BdyZWd", "url": "https://x.com/sohammehra_/status/2116288217498767670"}, {"author_id": "726566515", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:02:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116274629195038724"], "id": "2116274629195038724", "public_metr